        "1.7B",
        "auto",
        "bf16",
        "English",
        435637652599430,
        "randomize",
        "Character name: Lin Huaiyue\nVoice: a middle-aged male voice, loud and resonant, with a low register and strong force.\nBackground: chief advisor to a key national research project, a veteran strategic scientist nearing seventy. He took part in major national science and technology programs and, over decades of hardship, witnessed the difficult journey from catching up from behind to independent innovation. Now a lifetime honorary member of the National Science and Technology Advisory Committee, he still trains young talent on the front line and offers counsel on the country's strategic development.\nAppearance: upright posture, graying temples, a resolve between his brows that the years have settled there. He usually wears a dark Zhongshan suit or plain formal wear; his gaze is calm yet sharp, and every gesture carries authority and composure.\nPersonality: a will of steel and firm convictions, never backing down from a challenge; devoted to his homeland and the nation's future, binding his own fate to the rise and fall of the country; rigorous and self-disciplined, a man of his word, whose speech is full of responsibility and a sense of historical duty; cold on the outside but warm within, stern in appearance yet placing high hopes in the younger generation and glad to be a ladder for others.\nMotto: \"Our generation is not here to stand in the light, but to pave the road into the light.\"",
